    {
      "id": "b365393bda79-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The value of \\(\\frac{1}{3-\\sqrt{8}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}-\\sqrt{7}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{6}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{5}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}-2}\\) is equal to:",
      "questionHtml": "The value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3-\\sqrt{8}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}-\\sqrt{7}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{6}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{5}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}-2}\\)</span>&nbsp;is equal to:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{3 - \\sqrt{8}}=\\frac{1}{3 - \\sqrt{8}}\\times \\frac{3 + \\sqrt{8}}{3 + \\sqrt{8}}=3 + \\sqrt8\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Similarly, we can get</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{8}-\\sqrt{7}}=\\sqrt{8}+\\sqrt{7}\\)</span> ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}-\\sqrt{6}}=\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{6}\\)</span> <span style=\"\">⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{5}}=\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{5}\\)</span> ⇒ <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}-2}=\\sqrt{5}+2\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>On putting these values in the question,</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">3 + √8 - √8 - √7 + √7 + √6 - √6 - √5 + √5 + 2 = 5</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b365393bda79-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "The decimal expansion of the rational number \\(\\frac{{2457}}{{8750}}\\) will terminate after",
      "questionHtml": "<span style=\"\">The decimal expansion of the rational number&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{2457}}{{8750}}\\)</span> will terminate after</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "One decimal place",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">One decimal place</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Two decimal places",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">Two decimal places</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Four decimal places",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">Four decimal places</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Six decimal places",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">Six decimal places</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">The decimal expansion of the rational number&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"outline: yellow solid 2px; cursor: default; ;;\">\\(\\frac{{2457}}{{8750}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Concept Used:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Convert the given fraction into decimal.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\"><strong>Calculation:</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">The rational number&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"outline: yellow solid 2px; cursor: default; ;;\">\\(\\frac{{2457}}{{8750}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{2457}}{{8750}}\\)</span></span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{2457}}{{10 × 5^3 × 7}}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{351 × 2^3}}{{10 × 5^3 × 2^3 }}\\)</span>&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{​​2808}}{{10000 }}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 0.2808</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4; The decimal expansion of the rational number&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{{2457}}{{8750}}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;will terminate after four decimal places</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b365393bda79-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The value of \\(7.1\\overline{5}\\) is:",
      "questionHtml": "The value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(7.1\\overline{5}\\)</span>&nbsp;is:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(6\\frac{7}{45}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(6\\frac{7}{45}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(9\\frac{7}{45}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(9\\frac{7}{45}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(7\\frac{7}{45}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(7\\frac{7}{45}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "\\(8\\frac{9}{45}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(8\\frac{9}{45}\\)</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Given:</p>\n\n<p>A =&nbsp;<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(7.1\\overline{5}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">A = 7.15555555&nbsp; .........(1)</span></p>\n\n<p>Multiply&nbsp;equation&nbsp;1 with 10</p>\n\n<p>10 A = 71.55555&nbsp; ........(2)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Multiply&nbsp;equation</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;1 with 100</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">100 A = 715.55555&nbsp; ........(3)</span></p>\n\n<p>Subtracting equation 2&nbsp;from equation 3</p>\n\n<p>90 A = 715 - 71</p>\n\n<p><strong>A = 644/90</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The correct answer is&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\)</span><span class=\"math-tex\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: rgb(170, 204, 238) solid 2px; ;;;\">\\(7\\frac{7}{45}\\)</span>.</strong></p>\n<img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw==\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 22px; height: 22px;\" />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAPABAP///wAAACH5BAEKAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAICRAEAOw=="
      ],
      "subject": null,
