    },
    {
      "id": "b365393bda79-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Express \\(\\frac{4a^2}{\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}+b}\\) with rational denominator.",
      "questionHtml": "Express&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{4a^2}{\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}+b}\\)</span>&nbsp;with rational denominator.&nbsp;",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}}{b^2}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}}{b^2}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "\\(\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{2a^2+b}{b}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2a^2+b}{b}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4a 2 (2a - b)",
          "html": "4a<sup>2</sup>(2a - b)"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given :</strong></p>\n\n<p>Rationalise the expression&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{4a^2}{\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}+b}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation :</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{4a^2}{\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}+b}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{4a^2\\times (\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b)}{(\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}+b)\\times (\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b }\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{4a^2\\times (\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b)}{4a^2+b^2-b^2 }\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{4a^2\\times (\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b)}{4a^2}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The answer is&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\sqrt{4a^2+b^2}-b\\)</span>&nbsp;.</strong></p>\n",
